OL,3,GNEWSAScooter rider critically injured
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old scooter rider is in a
OL,7,F"critical but stable" condition in
OL,8,Fhospital following a three-vehicle
OL,9,Fcrash in Bradford, police have said.
OL,11,FThe collision, which happened at about
OL,12,F09:40 BST on Saturday on Canal Road,
OL,13,Fnear ACW Garden Centre, involved a
OL,14,FLambretta scooter, a grey Volkswagen
OL,15,FGolf and a black Volvo, according to
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police.
OL,18,FThe driver of the Golf, a 24-year-old
OL,19,Fman, was interviewed under caution and
OL,20,Finquiries were continuing, a force
OL,21,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
